OL,3,AA&E warning system to flag sick
OL,4,Achildren deteriorating quickly
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new early warning system is being
OL,7,Fintroduced in hospital emergency
OL,8,Fdepartments in England to help busy NHS
OL,9,Fstaff identify sick children who are
OL,10,Fdangerously deteriorating.
OL,12,FIt comes after Health Secretary Yvette
OL,13,FCooper promised to stop "corridor care"
OL,14,Ffor sick children because of long waits
OL,15,Ffor hospital beds.
OL,17,FThe new National Paediatric Early
OL,18,FWarning System (PEWS) asks staff to
OL,19,Fcheck, log and grade vital signs, such
OL,20,Fas blood pressure, heart rate and
OL,21,Foxygen levels.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
